  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 401.26 Rental boat",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-08-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 401.26 “Rental boat” means any boat available to another party for rent by the hour or any fraction thereof, day, week or season for recreational use exclusively.\n\nSource. #5448, eff 8-24-92, EXPIRED: 8-24-98\n\nNew. #7534, eff 7-25-01; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
